() Tj
T*
(The upload queue is used for retry/offline resilience.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RfidService) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Reads MFRC522 cards and formats UIDs as uppercase hex groups separated by `-`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(UI Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The firmware uses LVGL. UI refresh is intentionally split into different rates to) Tj
T*
(reduce CPU and memory pressure:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Main app tick: 4 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Chart refresh: about 16 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Slow UI refresh: about 140 ms.) Tj
T*
(- Debug UI refresh: about 160 ms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Screen-specific LVGL objects must be reset to `nullptr` when their parent screen/modal) Tj
T*
(is deleted. This prevents stale pointer crashes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration is user-specific and machine-type-specific. The flow includes:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Start load confirmation.) Tj
T*
(- Physical pin-load controls.) Tj
T*
(- Rep collection.) Tj
T*
(- Set analysis.) Tj
T*
(- Optional next load.) Tj
T*
(- Result and save.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Calibration records valid/rejected reps, ROM, velocity, load, confidence, action, and) Tj
T*
(recommendation data. Calibration is saved under:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(calibrations/{uid}/{machineTypeId}) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommendation Logic) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommendation is separate from physical pin load.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Pin load is machine-level physical state.) Tj
T*
(- Recommendation is user-specific advice.) Tj
T*
(- Recommendation must not automatically overwrite pin load.) Tj
T*
ET
