(Adding a New Machine) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Add a machine seed in `MachineRegistry`.) Tj
T*
(2. Define machine ID, machine type ID, display name, category, muscles, stroke length,) Tj
T*
(   min/max/increment, and default calibration weight.) Tj
T*
(3. Confirm goal templates and timing targets.) Tj
T*
(4. Rebuild firmware.) Tj
T*
(5. Verify Firebase machine config compatibility if cloud overrides are used.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
