() Tj
T*
(Firebase/TLS can be memory-sensitive on ESP32. The firmware:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Frees optional UI before training/upload.) Tj
T*
(- Uses NVS queueing.) Tj
T*
(- Limits payload sizes.) Tj
T*
(- Splits repSet patches under low memory.) Tj
T*
(- Avoids upload workers.) Tj
T*
(- Avoids direct heavy upload inside `finishTraining`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Known Limitations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Physical pin load is manual in the main firmware.) Tj
T*
(- Weight detection is a separate prototype.) Tj
T*
(- Firebase dashboard config is environment-based; local `.env` files must remain) Tj
T*
(  untracked.) Tj
T*
(- Automated test coverage is limited.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
